      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "land-header",
      "description": "CoastHeader: the land leading a screen, its edge an authored coastline, a coral Pin on the coastline.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-coast\"><div class=\"ds-land\"><h1>Good morning, Asha</h1><p>Smile Care Dental</p></div><div class=\"ds-edge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 390 34\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M0 0H390V12C350 28 300 33 250 25C200 17 170 8 120 14C80 19 50 31 0 26Z\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-pin\">3 to bill</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-coast{font-family:var(--font-sans,Figtree,system-ui,sans-serif);background:var(--ground)}.ds-land{background:var(--land);color:var(--land-ink);padding:20px 16px 8px}.ds-land h1{margin:0;font-size:1.625rem;line-height:1.15;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em}.ds-land p{margin:6px 0 16px;color:var(--land-muted)}.ds-edge{position:relative}.ds-edge svg{display:block;width:100%;height:34px;fill:var(--land)}.ds-pin{position:absolute;right:16px;top:4px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:32px;padding:4px 14px 4px 10px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--coral);color:var(--on-coral);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:700}"
    },
    {
